  <h2 id="methodology">How these figures were produced</h2>
  <p>This edition contains <strong>{{ operators | length }} operator records</strong> built from public terms, sweepstakes rules, help-center material and operator pages checked through {{ updatedAt | readableDate }}. Some operators publish a complete timing window; others publish only one stage or no stable timeframe. No funded-test observations are included yet. Every operator remains labeled <span class="badge pending">Pending</span> until a funded redemption completes under the site <a href="/methodology/">methodology</a>.</p>
  <p>Funded testing follows the site <a href="/methodology/">methodology</a>: we fund accounts with our own money, request redemptions as ordinary players, and record the time from request to funds received, split into the four stages above. No operator is told it is being tested. When funded tests complete, their observed timings are added to the comparison table and to the downloadable dataset as separate rows.</p>

